---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Setup complete" description="You're set up for Killflare Priority Alerts.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap tgrid">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--ember">Priority alerts</span>
      <h1>That's it — you're set up.</h1>
      <p class="tlede">We've got your area. You'll get a confirmation email shortly, seasonal reminders timed to your region's fire season, and a text if fire activity or the danger rating rises near you.</p>
      <div class="notice">
        <p><strong>If you hear nothing from us, that doesn't mean nothing is happening.</strong> Cell networks fail, texts get delayed, and our systems can break. Keep following your provincial emergency alerts — they are the authority, and if they tell you to go, go.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tnext">
        <h2>While you're waiting for fire season</h2>
        <p>The cheap work is the work that matters. Our priority list is ordered by impact per dollar, not by price.</p>
        <div class="tbtns">
          <a href="/start-here/" class="btn btn--ember">Start with the priority list</a>
          <a href="/regions/" class="btn btn--ghost">Read your regional guide</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="tfine">Questions, or want to change your area? <a href="mailto:hello@killflare.com">hello@killflare.com</a>. Cancel any time from your PayPal account.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .tgrid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; max-width: 760px; }
  .tgrid h1 { margin-top: 0.3rem; }
  .tlede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .tnext { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .tnext p { color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .tbtns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.1rem; }
  .tfine { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-top: 0.75rem; }
</style>
